      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i have people, sure. but they only talk to the old version of me. they're just being nice because they feel bad for me. it's actually worse... seeing the pity in their eyes. it just reminds me that the person they actually liked is dead. i feel like i'm just waiting for the world to realize i'm not really here anymore. like, if you're just existentially empty, why is there even a rule that says you have to keep trying?",
